  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "> LocalPlayer - returns the VRC Player API object of the local player. Will be null in editor or when a player leaves but you've cached it - use Utilities.IsValid to easily branch your logic on this.\nShouldn't LocalPlayer remain valid (locally) for the life of the local scene? That is, when the local player leaves, we don't care if our udon programs break locally, so it should be safe to cache indefinitely, shouldn't it?",
